{"vid":"WFwn-_yCODk","source":"WFwn-_yCODk.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Hello friends, and welcome back to the"},{"t":1.8,"txt":"HSC coach. Today we are going to talk"},{"t":3.8,"txt":"about a very important topic, which is"},{"t":6.2,"txt":"hot work safety. If you work in"},{"t":8.3,"txt":"construction, shutdown project,"},{"t":10.2,"txt":"fabrication yard, factories, or"},{"t":12,"txt":"maintenance activities, then this"},{"t":14,"txt":"toolbox talk is for you. Because hot"},{"t":16.6,"txt":"work is one of the leading causes of"},{"t":18.5,"txt":"workplace fires and explosions. And"},{"t":20.8,"txt":"honestly, many hot work accidents happen"},{"t":23.6,"txt":"because workers ignore simple safety"},{"t":26.4,"txt":"precautions. So, please watch this video"},{"t":28.8,"txt":"carefully till the end. First of all,"},{"t":31.2,"txt":"let's understand what hot work actually"},{"t":33.8,"txt":"means."},{"t":34.8,"txt":"Hot work includes any activity that can"},{"t":37.6,"txt":"create spark, flames, heat, molten"},{"t":41.3,"txt":"metals. Examples include welding, gas"},{"t":44.1,"txt":"cutting, grinding, brazing, soldering."},{"t":47.6,"txt":"So, these are the examples. These"},{"t":49.7,"txt":"activities may look normal on site, but"},{"t":52.2,"txt":"they can become extremely dangerous if"},{"t":54.7,"txt":"proper precautions are not followed."},{"t":57.2,"txt":"Now, let me share a real site example."},{"t":60,"txt":"At one industrial project, a worker was"},{"t":62.6,"txt":"doing grinding work near stored paint"},{"t":65.4,"txt":"thinner container. Nobody checked the"},{"t":67.5,"txt":"area properly before starting the job."},{"t":70.6,"txt":"During grinding, sparks traveled several"},{"t":73.7,"txt":"meters and reached the flammable"},{"t":75.5,"txt":"materials. Within seconds, fire started"},{"t":78.4,"txt":"spreading. Workers panicked, and the"},{"t":81.7,"txt":"entire area had to be evacuated. Guys,"},{"t":85.3,"txt":"this incident happened because of poor"},{"t":87.5,"txt":"housekeeping and lack of risk"},{"t":89.3,"txt":"assessment. Always remember this,"},{"t":91.8,"txt":"hot work and flammable materials should"},{"t":94,"txt":"never be together. Before starting any"},{"t":96.6,"txt":"hot work, remove combustible materials,"},{"t":99.4,"txt":"check surrounding areas, use fire"},{"t":102.2,"txt":"blankets if needed, keep fire"},{"t":104.5,"txt":"extinguishers nearby."},{"t":106.5,"txt":"Now, let's talk about the hot work"},{"t":108.1,"txt":"permit. Many workers think the permit is"},{"t":110.8,"txt":"just paperwork, but actually the permit"},{"t":113.1,"txt":"is there to save lives."},{"t":115.4,"txt":"A proper hot work permit confirms the"},{"t":117.8,"txt":"area is inspected, fire hazards are"},{"t":120.3,"txt":"controlled, gas testing is completed if"},{"t":123.1,"txt":"required. Fire extinguisher is"},{"t":125.1,"txt":"available, fire watch is assigned. Never"},{"t":127.9,"txt":"start hot work without authorizations."},{"t":130.8,"txt":"Even a small welding job can create a"},{"t":133.1,"txt":"major fire."},{"t":134.5,"txt":"Here is another real site example."},{"t":137.3,"txt":"At one shutdown project, welding work"},{"t":139.6,"txt":"was happening inside the"},{"t":142,"txt":"confined area."},{"t":143.5,"txt":"The workers did not test the atmosphere"},{"t":146.6,"txt":"there was flammable gas present inside"},{"t":148.6,"txt":"the space. As soon as welding started, a"},{"t":151.4,"txt":"flash fire occurred."},{"t":153.4,"txt":"Two workers suffered serious burn"},{"t":155.4,"txt":"injuries. Guys, this is why gas testing"},{"t":158.6,"txt":"is extremely important, especially in"},{"t":161.5,"txt":"tanks, vessels, pipelines, confined"},{"t":164.1,"txt":"spaces. Never assume the area is safe."},{"t":167,"txt":"Always test before starting work. Now,"},{"t":169.7,"txt":"let's discuss the fire watch"},{"t":171,"txt":"responsibilities."},{"t":172.6,"txt":"A fire watch is not just someone"},{"t":174.9,"txt":"standing nearby doing nothing. The fire"},{"t":177.6,"txt":"watch persons must monitor spark, watch"},{"t":181.6,"txt":"surrounding areas, keep extinguisher"},{"t":183.8,"txt":"ready, stop unsafe work immediately, and"},{"t":186.6,"txt":"remember,"},{"t":188.2,"txt":"fire can start even after the work is"},{"t":190.4,"txt":"completed. That's why post work"},{"t":192.5,"txt":"monitoring is very important. Some fires"},{"t":195.2,"txt":"start 30 minutes later because hidden"},{"t":198,"txt":"sparks remain active."},{"t":200.4,"txt":"Another common mistake on site is poor"},{"t":202.6,"txt":"housekeeping. Guys, hot work area should"},{"t":205.8,"txt":"always be clean. Do not allow oil"},{"t":208.2,"txt":"spills, paper waste, wooden materials,"},{"t":211.3,"txt":"cloth pieces, chemical containers near"},{"t":214.1,"txt":"hot work activities. Good housekeeping"},{"t":216.4,"txt":"prevents fire hazards. Now, let's talk"},{"t":218.9,"txt":"about PPE. During hot work, workers"},{"t":221.7,"txt":"should always wear welding helmet or"},{"t":224,"txt":"face shield, fire resistance gloves,"},{"t":226.8,"txt":"safety shoes, protective clothing,"},{"t":228.8,"txt":"safety goggles. Never do welding or"},{"t":231.4,"txt":"grinding without eye and face"},{"t":233.8,"txt":"protections. One spark can permanently"},{"t":236.2,"txt":"damage your eyesight."},{"t":238.4,"txt":"Here is one more real incident. A worker"},{"t":240.8,"txt":"was cutting metal without using a face"},{"t":243.2,"txt":"shield properly. A hot metal particle"},{"t":245.8,"txt":"entered his eyes and the injury was"},{"t":248.5,"txt":"serious and he required surgery. All"},{"t":251.9,"txt":"this happened because he ignored basic"},{"t":253.9,"txt":"PPE. Guys, PPE may feel uncomfortable"},{"t":257.3,"txt":"sometimes, but accidents are much worse."},{"t":260.2,"txt":"Another important point is ventilation."},{"t":263.4,"txt":"During welding and cutting, harmful"},{"t":265.4,"txt":"fumes and smoke are"},{"t":267.3,"txt":"generated. If ventilation is poor,"},{"t":269.7,"txt":"workers may suffer breathing problems,"},{"t":272,"txt":"dizziness, eye irritations, long-term"},{"t":274.9,"txt":"lung damage. Always ensure proper"},{"t":277.2,"txt":"ventilation during hot work activities,"},{"t":279.9,"txt":"especially in confined or enclosed"},{"t":282.4,"txt":"areas. So, before ending this toolbox"},{"t":284.8,"txt":"talk, let's quickly remember the"},{"t":286.6,"txt":"important hot work safety rules. Never"},{"t":289.4,"txt":"start work without hot work permit,"},{"t":292,"txt":"remove flammable materials from the"},{"t":293.7,"txt":"area,"},{"t":294.9,"txt":"keep fire extinguisher nearby, conduct"},{"t":297.5,"txt":"gas testing when required, use proper"},{"t":300,"txt":"PPE, maintain good housekeeping, assign"},{"t":303,"txt":"trained fire watch, ensure proper"},{"t":305.2,"txt":"ventilation, stop work if unsafe"},{"t":307.7,"txt":"conditions are found. Remember, guys,"},{"t":310.2,"txt":"one small spark can cause a huge"},{"t":313,"txt":"disaster. Never take hot work safety"},{"t":315.8,"txt":"lightly. If you found this video useful,"},{"t":318.2,"txt":"please like the video, share it with"},{"t":320,"txt":"your co-workers, and subscribe to the"},{"t":322.1,"txt":"HSC coach for more safety training"},{"t":324.2,"txt":"videos."},{"t":325.5,"txt":"Thanks for watching. Stay safe, stay"},{"t":327,"txt":"alert, and see you in the next video."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Hello"},{"t":0.24,"w":"friends,"},{"t":0.6,"w":"and"},{"t":0.8,"w":"welcome"},{"t":1.16,"w":"back"},{"t":1.48,"w":"to"},{"t":1.6,"w":"the"},{"t":1.84,"w":"HSC"},{"t":2.2,"w":"coach."},{"t":2.72,"w":"Today"},{"t":2.96,"w":"we"},{"t":3.12,"w":"are"},{"t":3.24,"w":"going"},{"t":3.48,"w":"to"},{"t":3.56,"w":"talk"},{"t":3.8,"w":"about"},{"t":4.2,"w":"a"},{"t":4.28,"w":"very"},{"t":4.64,"w":"important"},{"t":5.12,"w":"topic,"},{"t":5.48,"w":"which"},{"t":5.64,"w":"is"},{"t":6.16,"w":"hot"},{"t":6.4,"w":"work"},{"t":6.6,"w":"safet